FIELD RULES:
- "description": short human-readable summary of the code's purpose (max 1 sentence).
- "service": the company or service name sending the code.
- "code_type": must be one of: otp, 2fa, verification, login, magic_link, other.
- "expires_in_minutes": number of minutes until the code expires, or null if unknown.
- "url": full clickable URL for magic links, or null for regular codes.
- For magic links, use the full URL as both "code" and "url".
